@startuml
title 图5-3 订单管理模块 C 端创建订单与模拟支付时序图

skinparam shadowing false

actor 用户 as U
participant "微信小程序" as MP
participant "AppOrderController" as AC
participant "IClOrderService" as OS
participant "IClGoodsService" as GS
participant "ClOrderMapper" as OM
database "MySQL" as DB

U -> MP : 提交订单
MP -> AC : POST /api/app/order/create
AC -> AC : 按 type 路由\nsingle / multi
AC -> GS : 校验商品上架与库存
GS -> DB : 查询 cl_goods
DB --> GS
GS --> AC : 校验结果
AC -> OS : 生成订单号、汇总金额
OS -> OM : insertClOrder\ninsertClOrderItem
OM -> DB : 事务写入\ncl_order, cl_order_item
opt 定制订单 orderType=1
  OS -> DB : 写入 cl_custom_order\n排队信息
end
DB --> OM : OK
OM --> OS : orderId
OS --> AC : 结果
AC --> MP : { code, data: orderId }
MP --> U : 跳转订单详情

U -> MP : 模拟支付
MP -> AC : POST /api/app/order/mockPay
AC -> OS : 更新状态 0→1
OS -> DB : UPDATE cl_order
DB --> OS
OS --> AC : OK
AC --> MP : AjaxResult
MP --> U : 展示已支付

@enduml
